<title>USA: Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.95		    $0.81</p>
<p> Oper net		  398,000		  339,000</p>
<p> Revs		    3,623,000		3,370,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  418,300		  419,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>			 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $2.73		    $2.48</p>
<p> Oper net		1,141,000		1,040,000</p>
<p> Revs		   10,613,000	     10,155,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  418,500		  419,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 net and shr exclude gain on discontinued operations of $5 million, or $0.01/shr.</p>
<p>1995 9-mos net and shr exclude gain on discontinued operations of $33 million, or $0.08/shr.</p>
<p>Full name is Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
